96-## A11.4 Dependency duty for registered decisions
97-
98-When a registered decision changes a parameter (an algorithm, a custody form, a channel, a horizon, a scope, a key),
99-the owner sweeps the registered texts for sentences whose referent the change alters. Each one is recorded as
100-amended, superseded, still fitting or open, before the decision's change is treated as complete. An owner decision
101-that touches a registered parameter is checked against those texts before it is recorded.
